关于数据内容的说明 / Note on data:

本许可仅适用于仓库内的代码。metadata/ 与 notes/ 中的书目信息与馆藏描述
摘自已公开的图书馆、档案馆页面，著作权归各原机构。图片未包含在本仓库中。

This license covers the source code only. Bibliographic
records and collection descriptions are derived from publicly accessible
library and archive pages and remain the property of the respective
institutions. No image files are included in this repository.

